# ── Make api call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
@When "^retrieves Cortex formula configurations for product '([^']*)'$"
    Given build request as user 'maker@example.com'
    When get from path '/products/$1/cortex-formulas'
    And attach the response body to the report

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@Then "^the Cortex formula catalogue retrieved successfully$"
    Then the 'Cortex formula catalogue' should be 'retrieved' successfully
